{"unit_id":"meimiaoji-creator__meow-vision#card-zh","repo":"meimiaoji-creator/meow-vision","commit":"513d00c19bc23c843413443ccda8e67f9ac23540","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"meow-vision 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的视觉与界面预览插件，提供 meow_vision 和 meow_preview 两个工具。meow_vision 将图片交给用户在 DSH 中配置的视觉模型，并把文字描述返回给当前会话；meow_preview 可渲染 Vue demo、HTML 文件或网页并回传截图，便于检查组件的实际样式和布局。插件还提供设置面板，用来选择视觉模型及配置预览项目。适合需要让文本模型理解图片，或迭代检查 UI 组件渲染效果的 DSH 用户。视觉识图复用 DSH 已配置的模型；组件预览需有 Vite Vue 项目及 Edge 或 Chrome。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:48-73","lib/index.js:82-136","lib/client.js:283-299","lib/preview.js:249-295"]}
{"unit_id":"meimiaoji-creator__meow-vision#card-en","repo":"meimiaoji-creator/meow-vision","commit":"513d00c19bc23c843413443ccda8e67f9ac23540","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"meow-vision adds image description and UI preview tools to DSH web. meow_vision sends images to a configured vision model and returns text. meow_preview renders Vue demos, HTML, or web pages and returns screenshots for checking component styling. Preview needs a Vite Vue project and Edge or Chrome.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:48-73","lib/index.js:82-136","lib/client.js:283-299","lib/preview.js:249-295"]}
